@startuml
title State machine for Ott Based System Mini Reel

state "Initial" as Initial
state AccountCreation
state VideoWatching
state VideoUploading
state LikesListSaving
state DiscussionEntry
state Final

[*] --> Initial : /Start

Initial --> AccountCreation : CreateAccount

AccountCreation --> VideoWatching : WatchVideos
AccountCreation --> VideoUploading : UploadVideo

VideoWatching --> LikesListSaving : SaveToLikesList
VideoWatching --> VideoWatching : ContinueWatching

LikesListSaving --> VideoWatching : ViewSavedVideos

DiscussionEntry --> DiscussionEntry : EnterDiscussionOption

VideoUploading --> VideoWatching : FinishUploadAndWatch

Final --> [*] : LogoutOrDeleteAccount

@enduml
